414 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 321 0 R
/E (The courier and logistics industry handles a large number of shipments every day, making accurate shipment management, timely delivery, and effective communication essential for business operations. Traditional methods such as paper registers, spreadsheets, phone calls, and manual status updates can make it difficult to maintain accurate information and coordinate activities between branches, customers, and delivery agents.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
415 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 321 0 R
/E (The Courier Management System \(CMS\) is a Salesforce-based cloud application developed to provide a centralized platform for managing courier operations. The system allows organizations to maintain customer information, register shipments, assign delivery agents, monitor shipment status, manage branch information, generate invoices, and analyze operational performance.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
416 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 321 0 R
/E (The system uses Salesforce custom objects, relationships, validation rules, Salesforce Flows, reports, dashboards, and security features to automate important courier activities. By bringing these functions together in one platform, CMS provides better visibility of shipment information and reduces dependency on manual processes.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
417 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 321 0 R
/E (The proposed system is designed to support courier organizations in improving operational coordination, maintaining accurate records, reducing processing errors, and providing better service to customers.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
